{"id":"vod_bf_37963","vodId":"37963","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"夏目友人帐第三季","name_cn":"夏目友人帐第三季","date":"2011-01-01","year":"2011","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-39/fff00691b9dc30053ab51ac5945cc0c6.jpg"},"summary":"现正在白泉社旗下的少女漫画杂志《LaLa》上刊载的《夏目友人帐》，于白泉社的《夏目友人帐》官网上突然更新了一个天大喜讯——在2月24号发售的《LaLa 4月号》，《夏目友人帐》将会迎来一个重大发表! 是TV动画第三期吗　　这对于夏目的fans来说也是值得高兴的消息。《夏目友人帐》的故事主要是说男主角夏目贵志，继承了祖母夏目玲子拥有看到妖怪的力量，而且因为祖母年轻时曾夺取了不少妖怪的名字，并把名字都记在了《友人帐》上，使不少妖怪会来找夏目希望拿回自己的名字。每一集都会描述妖怪和妖怪，或妖怪和人类的故事，把各种交错的心灵，迭交的思念，还有人与妖怪的种种隔阂都描写出来，是一部既治愈温暖又带点哀伤的佳作。《夏目友人帐》曾两度TV动画化，所以对于今次的重大发表，当然是期待第三季的来临了！","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"剧情,动画,奇幻"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-04-29 22:52:37","classic":true,"classicRank":23,"franchise":"夏目友人帐","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/xiamuyourenzhangdisanji/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/xiamuyourenzhangdisanji/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/xiamuyourenzhangdisanji/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/xiamuyourenzhangdisanji/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/xiamuyourenzhangdisanji/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/xiamuyourenzhangdisanji/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/xiamuyourenzhangdisanji/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/xiamuyourenzhangdisanji/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/xiamuyourenzhangdisanji/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/xiamuyourenzhangdisanji/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/xiamuyourenzhangdisanji/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com